    <h1>Accessibility</h1>
    <p class="small muted">Effective and last updated: {{ legalEffectiveDate }}</p>

    <p>
      People reach this site under real pressure, sometimes on an old phone with a bad
      connection. It should work for everyone. We aim to meet WCAG 2.1 Level AA.
    </p>

    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Semantic HTML with a logical heading order and landmark regions.</li>
      <li>A skip link to the main content.</li>
      <li>Visible focus indicators on every interactive element.</li>
      <li>Form fields with real, associated labels, and errors announced to screen readers.</li>
      <li>Touch targets at least 48 pixels tall.</li>
      <li>Text that reflows without horizontal scrolling down to 320 pixels wide.</li>
      <li>Reduced-motion support honoring your system preference.</li>
      <li>No content that depends on color alone to be understood.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Known limitations</h2>
    <p>
      Third-party analytics we embed are outside our direct control. If you hit a barrier
      anywhere, tell us and we will fix it.
    </p>

    <h2>Tell us about a problem</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>, call
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>, or text
      <a href="sms:{{ site.smsRaw }}">{{ site.smsDisplay }}</a>. Describe the page and
      what went wrong. We aim to respond within two business days.
    </p>
    <p>
      If any part of this site is not usable for you, call us and we will take your
      information and give you an offer over the phone. You should never be shut out of
      selling your house because a web page failed you.
    </p>
